# Last-known-good pakset commits for the CI smoke harness, per branch of the pakset
# repository (github.com/jamespetts/simutrans-pak128.britain).
#
# Consumed by .github/workflows/run-tests.yml (blocking harness: the pakset is compiled
# from the pinned commit with makeobj built from the engine commit under test, so the
# pak file version always matches the engine, and any run is reproducible from history).
# Advanced ONLY by .github/workflows/pakset-pin.yml, which compiles the pakset branch
# head and runs the full harness against it; the pin moves only on a green run
# (last-known-good ratchet: pakset regressions can never fail push/PR CI).
#
# Format: <pakset repo branch> = <full commit sha>
master = bda8bde09f1d5644cda43998a4251366d5ee9a10
